{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o057c","title":"郭修刺杀费祎","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o057c-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"郭修刺杀费祎","evidence":["shaodi-e-o057c-q"]},{"id":"shaodi-a-p018-stabbing-account","label":"《魏氏春秋》","text":"《魏氏春秋》称郭修谋刺刘禅不成，故杀费祎。","evidence":["shaodi-q-p018-stabbing-account"]},{"id":"shaodi-a-p019-stabbing-critique","label":"裴松之论","text":"裴松之论郭修杀身既无魏禄之责又非时主所使，认为义无所加功无所立；保留其对刺杀正当性的批评。","evidence":["shaodi-q-p019-stabbing-critique"]},{"id":"houzhu-a-898c034b9b1e","label":"《后主传》正文","text":"十六年春正月，大将军费祎为魏降人郭修所杀于汉寿。","evidence":["houzhu-q-O060"]},{"id":"jfj-a-o029a","label":"正文 · 延熙十六年岁首","text":"郭修在岁首宴会刺杀费祎","evidence":["jfj-q0119"]},{"id":"jfj-a-o040a","label":"正文 · 延熙十六年春","text":"费祎春季去世","evidence":["jfj-q0151"]},{"id":"huangli-a-15b56ca18936af050ba1","label":"正文","text":"费祎遇害于郭修","evidence":["huangli-q-c5d66e44f07a43bde2c9"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0049","role":"刺杀","evidence":["shaodi-e-o057c-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0051","role":"被刺","evidence":["shaodi-e-o057c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"往岁（诏书回述）","precision":"relative","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["shaodi-e-o057c-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o057c-q","source_order":[4,242,"O057c"],"order":1097}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0049","name":"郭修","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0051","name":"费祎","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houzhu-q-O060","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-1f37e1b42e65df576a4b","layer":"original","quote":"十六年春正月，大将军费祎为魏降人郭修所杀于汉寿。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":118,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24},{"id":"huangli-q-c5d66e44f07a43bde2c9","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-3c802f54bceca5d153c1","layer":"original","quote":"后祎果为魏降人郭修所害","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":245,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":40,"end":51},{"id":"jfj-q0119","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-8057c101f8e5c1e65768","layer":"original","quote":"十六年岁首大会〖30〗，魏降人郭修在坐。祎欢饮沉醉，为修手刃所害","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":115,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32},{"id":"jfj-q0151","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-17531dc8d5be031fa190","layer":"original","quote":"十六年春〖10〗，祎卒。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":180,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":12},{"id":"shaodi-e-o057c-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-62de37a81864196f8119","layer":"original","quote":"八月，诏曰：“故中郎西平郭修〖2〗，砥节厉行，秉心不回〖3〗。乃者蜀将姜维寇抄修郡〖4〗，为所执略。往岁伪大将军费祎，驱率群众〖5〗，阴图窥窬〖6〗；道经汉寿〖7〗，请会众宾。修于广坐之中，手刃击祎〖8〗，勇过聂政〖9〗，功逾介子〖10〗。可谓杀身成仁，释生取义者矣〖11〗。夫追加褒宠，所以表扬忠义；祚及后胤，所以奖劝将来。其追封修为长乐乡侯，食邑千户，谥曰威侯；子袭爵，加拜奉车都尉〖12〗；赐银千鉼〖13〗，绢千匹。以光宠存亡〖14〗，永垂来世焉。”﹝三﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":241,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":231},{"id":"shaodi-q-p018-stabbing-account","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-5c35212fabc5cc58302f","layer":"pei","quote":"每因庆贺，且拜且前；为禅左右所遏，事辄不克，故杀祎焉。","attribution":"《魏氏春秋》","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":264,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8cc9180077c660fd8f82","start":55,"end":82},{"id":"shaodi-q-p019-stabbing-critique","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-df60847a0d457632ff57","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之以为：古之舍生取义者，必有理存焉。或感恩怀德，投命无悔；或利害有机，奋发以应会：诏所称聂政、介子是也。事非斯类，则陷乎妄作矣。魏之与蜀，虽为敌国；非有赵襄灭智之仇，燕丹危亡之急。且刘禅凡下之主，费祎中才之相；二人存亡，固无关于兴丧。郭修在魏，西州之男子耳。始获于蜀，既不能抗节不辱；于魏又无食禄之责，不为时主所使。而无故规规然糜身于非所，义无所加，功无所立，可谓“折柳樊圃”；其狂也且，此之谓也。","attribution":"裴松之论","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":265,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8cc9180077c660fd8f82","start":0,"end":201}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
